msgid "Custom color"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1229
msgid "Background behind the cards. Set it apart from the card background to make the cards stand out. \"Follow the visitor browser\" uses a light grey or a very dark grey according to the prefers-color-scheme setting. Default: Transparent"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1235
msgid "The color above applies only with \"Custom color\"."
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1247
msgid "Neutral preset (white)"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1248
msgid "Transparent"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1254
msgid "Background of each post card. \"Transparent\" drops the card surface and its shadow, leaving only the border. Default: Neutral preset"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1260
msgid "The color above applies only with \"Custom color\". Pick a dark one and the post text, the stats and the icons switch to their light variants on their own."
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1272
msgid "Platform colors"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1273
msgid "Single color (same as the post text)"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:1277
msgid "The SVG icons are monochrome outlines and carry no color of their own: the stylesheet paints them. Platform colors use the official color of each platform, lightened when the surface is dark. A single color follows the post text, so the icons turn white on a dark card. Default: Platform colors"
msgstr ""

